Unreleased
==========
* Track each successful CAS login as an authentication session so SLO still
  finds and removes the session, service ticket and proxy granting ticket
  after the Django session key was rotated.
* Ignore repeated or concurrent logout notifications for the same ticket, so
  each authentication session is reported to ``cas_user_logout`` once.
* Add ``auth_session_id`` to the ``cas_user_logout`` signal for audit
  consumers.
* Requires the ``0004`` migration.

5.1.2 (2026-10-28)
==================
* Updated homepage and doc links
* Update docs to encourage minimum version Django 5.2.
* Validate the login ``next`` parameter when ``CAS_LOGIN_NEXT_PAGE`` is unset.
* Don't update groups via attribute with CAS_APPLY_ATTRIBUTES_TO_USER.

5.1.1 (2026-05-05)
==================
* Fixed bug where it was possible for CAS_APPLY_ATTRIBUTES_TO_USER to
  interfere with the username.
* Support POST logout requests
* Add support for Django 5.2.
* Add CAS_STAFF_AFFILIATION setting
* Refactored clean_sessions()
